00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:17.170
MARTIN OMANDER: So we're trying
to keep it serverless, which

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:22.540
would mean NoSQL,
and I'm also thinking

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:24.880
there won't be too
many reports of-- we

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:28.040
won't do too many aggregations,
like averages, and sums,

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:29.505
and stuff like that, right?

00:03:29.505 --> 00:03:30.880
DINA GRAVES PORTMAN:
I think just

00:03:30.880 --> 00:03:33.550
thinking about how the people
are interacting with the data

00:03:33.550 --> 00:03:37.960
and also how I would
model the data,

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.960
NoSQL is really feeling
like the right direction

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:44.020
because they're not going
to have to do big reports.

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:47.540
And even when you think
about, like, we have a server,

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:50.540
the server is represented
by the IP address

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:53.310
and then we have a set
of ports underneath it.

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:57.970
So if I were to have a
document in a NoSQL database,

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:00.700
the document, the ID
would be the IP address,

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:06.400
and then we'd have the list of
ports in it as rows and then

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:08.110
whether or not it
should be open.

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:08.590
MARTIN OMANDER: Oh, yeah.

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:10.510
It's kind of hierarchical
like that, yeah.

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:11.530
I agree.

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:13.600
So yeah, let's go for NoSQL.

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:15.375
Firestore is great
and serverless,

00:04:15.375 --> 00:04:16.750
so it would go
very well together

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:18.560
with the other serverless
components here.

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:20.810
Each document, I guess,
would be a server.

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:23.980
And as you said, underneath
it has ports, and permissions,

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:25.060
and things.

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:26.560
DINA GRAVES PORTMAN:
For our auditor

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:28.690
and also for just
our peace of mind,

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:33.910
