00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:35.830
we can check that all
the ports that are open

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:37.840
are the ones that
have been approved,

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:42.480
and I want this
to happen nightly,

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:44.710
and I don't want
any interaction.

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:47.190
MARTIN OMANDER: OK, so nobody
