00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:24.342
What kind of component
should it call, I wonder?

00:05:24.342 --> 00:05:26.550
DINA GRAVES PORTMAN: So
thinking of the functionality

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:30.300
that we want, what
we want to do is

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:34.740
we want to have the
IP address and we

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:38.490
want to attempt
to make a request

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:42.090
to connect to every single
port on the IP address.

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:45.930
So we're thinking about,
like, nested for loops, which

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:47.370
