00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:49.237
Oh my gosh.

00:05:49.237 --> 00:05:50.820
But the first thing
that we need to do

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:55.890
is we need to get the
list of IP addresses.

00:05:55.890 --> 00:06:00.780
So maybe we can break up this
functionality a little bit

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:05.190
and have the first function
just call to Firestore

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:06.865
