00:06:06.865 --> 00:06:08.490
MARTIN OMANDER: Oh,
I really like that.

00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:10.860
Yeah, so OK, so that first
function is really simple.

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:13.950
Like you said, it just
