00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:44.670
something's going
to break, and it's

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:45.990
going to take a really
long time, and then

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:48.282
what are you going to do,
just restart the whole thing?

00:06:48.282 --> 00:06:48.840
So--

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:50.700
MARTIN OMANDER: Yeah.

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:52.840
Right.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:54.340
DINA GRAVES PORTMAN:
I'd really like

00:06:54.340 --> 00:07:00.450
