you said asynchronous.

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:06.580
When you say asynchronous, Dina,
that makes me think of Pub/Sub.

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:09.910
So would it work if the
orchestration function

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:13.630
