one port on that one server

00:07:37.563 --> 00:07:39.980
and we don't have to worry
about the hundreds of thousands

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:42.350
or millions of other ports.

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:43.340
It's just the one.

00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:44.690
MARTIN OMANDER: Yeah, right?

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:46.920
So it doesn't get
stuck, no time outs.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:47.420
OK.

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:48.420
This is really good.

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:52.670
So the port tester, then,
gets just one server

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:55.190
