one of these messages,

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:53.110
it does what you just described.

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:55.900
It calls an email,
API sends an email.

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:56.410
Cool.

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:57.020
DINA GRAVES PORTMAN: I love it.

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:59.020
MARTIN OMANDER: So we have
