00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:45.720
and we're going to have a
filtered subscription that

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:49.470
sends the bad results
back to App Engine,

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:51.960
we're going to trigger
an email to our admin,

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:55.800
and then we have all of our
results going into BigQuery,

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:59.080
